<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Feature<sp/>toggles</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Enable<sp/>only<sp/>the<sp/>subsystem<sp/>being<sp/>implemented<sp/>to<sp/>keep<sp/>feedback<sp/>loops<sp/>short.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Lua<sp/>and<sp/>registry<sp/>can<sp/>stay<sp/>optional<sp/>while<sp/>SAT/SMT<sp/>core<sp/>and<sp/>package<sp/>flow<sp/>are<sp/>hardened.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Documentation<sp/>generation<sp/>stays<sp/>conditional<sp/>but<sp/>on<sp/>by<sp/>default<sp/>in<sp/>project<sp/>options.</highlight></codeline>
