<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>top-level<sp/>`CMakeLists.txt`<sp/>defines<sp/>core<sp/>targets:<sp/>`sattyre`,<sp/>`sattyre-cabi`,<sp/>and<sp/>CLI<sp/>binaries.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Optional<sp/>docs<sp/>logic<sp/>should<sp/>include<sp/>`docs/CMakeFiles.txt`<sp/>only<sp/>when<sp/>Doxygen<sp/>exists.</highlight></codeline>
